<section class="chapter chapter--light about-section" id="overview" data-page-panel="overview" data-chapter="01" data-label-en="OVERVIEW" data-label-zh="概览" data-label-vi="TỔNG QUAN">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="chapter__head about-section__head">
      <span class="chapter__num reveal">01</span>
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">
        <span class="lang en">Overview</span>
        <span class="lang vi">Tổng quan</span>
        <span class="lang zh">概览</span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="chapter__title chapter__title--sm">
        <span class="lang en">
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Who we are</span></span>
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line line--muted">in numbers that matter.</span></span>
        </span>
        <span class="lang vi">
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Chúng tôi là ai</span></span>
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line line--muted">qua những chỉ số then chốt.</span></span>
        </span>
        <span class="lang zh">
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">我们是谁</span></span>
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line line--muted">用关键指标说明。</span></span>
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="chapter__desc reveal" data-delay="150">
        <span class="lang en">From feed production to logistics, ports and strategic investments, we expand one ecosystem for customers, partners and communities.</span>
        <span class="lang vi">Từ thức ăn chăn nuôi đến logistics, kho cảng và đầu tư chiến lược, chúng tôi mở rộng một hệ sinh thái phục vụ khách hàng, đối tác và xã hội.</span>
        <span class="lang zh">从饲料生产到物流、港口与战略投资，我们拓展同一生态系统，服务客户、伙伴与社区。</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="stats about-stats reveal">
      <div class="stat" data-delay="0">
        <span class="stat__value"><span data-count="20">0</span>+</span>
